sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>curl / test harness
    participant CMux as cmux Listener<br/>8000/TCP<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    participant HTTP as HTTP Server<br/>fasthttp
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>VllmEngine
    participant Engine as Engine Backend<br/>vLLM / SGLang
    participant Proc as Processor
    participant Queue as Worker Queue
    participant Gen as Response Generator<br/>Echo / Random
    participant KV as Block Cache<br/>KV Cache
    participant Encoder as Event Encoder<br/>msgpack
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Publisher<br/>5557/TCP
    participant Router as llm-d-router
    participant Render as vllm-render<br/>8082/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>CMux: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP or gRPC
    alt HTTP Request
        CMux->>HTTP: Route to HTTP handler
        HTTP->>Engine: Dispatch via engine routes
    else gRPC Request
        CMux->>GRPC: Route to gRPC service
        GRPC->>Engine: Generate RPC
    end
    Engine->>Proc: Process request
    Proc->>Queue: Enqueue with concurrency limit
    Queue->>Gen: Generate response tokens

    alt Streaming Response
        loop For each token
            Gen-->>Engine: Token on channel
            Engine-->>Client: SSE: data: {"choices":[...]}
        end
        Gen-->>Engine: Done
        Engine-->>Client: SSE: data: [DONE]
    else Non-Streaming Response
        Gen-->>Engine: All tokens
        Engine-->>Client: JSON response body
    end

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 2: KV Cache Event Publishing

    Gen->>KV: Update block cache<br/>Simulated allocation
    KV->>Encoder: Block stored/removed events<br/>Batched
    Encoder->>ZMQ: msgpack-encoded events
    ZMQ->>Router: ZMQ PUB message<br/>Cache-aware scheduling data

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: HuggingFace Tokenization (Optional)

    Client->>CMux: POST /tokenize or /v1/.../render
    CMux->>HTTP: Route request
    HTTP->>Render: GET tokenization<br/>HTTP localhost:8082
    Render->>HF: Download tokenizer<br/>HTTPS, Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>Render: Tokenizer model files
    Render-->>HTTP: Token IDs
    HTTP-->>Client: Tokenization result
